	<string>## Shell History

Search your zsh or bash shell history via the `shell` keyword.

- &lt;kbd&gt;⏎&lt;/kbd&gt;: Paste the command to the frontmost app.
- &lt;kbd&gt;⌘&lt;/kbd&gt;&lt;kbd&gt;C&lt;/kbd&gt;: Copy the command to the clipboard.

